abstract: >-
  Temporal AI Presence is sustained bounded AI participation across time. This
  canonical release candidate defines the temporal-presence category, preserves
  the distinction between TAP and c-class systems, normalizes ten mandatory TAP
  tests, records provenance and current evidence limits, and supplies a
  machine-readable normative contract. It does not claim implementation
  closure, TAP conformance, consciousness, personhood, sovereignty, or an
  assigned standalone DOI.
